window.products.push({"id":272009,"name":"SEDETA Bookcase 4-Tier Bookshelf with Doors and Drawers, Rustic Wood Bookshelves, Industrial Bookshelf Display, Shelves Cabinet Book Shelf Cube for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZFg7O3k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ 4-Tier Multi-function Bookshelf ] Overall size: 47.2\" Length x 11.8\" Width x 62.8\" Height. Large storage capacity provides you with large storage space to display normal stuff like books, CDs, magazines, photo frames, potted plants. It not only a bookcase or bookshelf, it also used as a display shelf, storage cabinet or room divider. Sedeta modern bookcase would definitely be a nice addition for your living room, bedroom, office, hallway, corridor, wall corner, kitchen and so on. [ Sturdy Construction ] Constructed by premium iron and selected particleboard, the contemporary bookcase is absolutely solid, 3cm by 2cm width Metal frame enough to support heavy duty parcels, which ensures stability and durability. In case of wobbling after finishing assembling, we have an anti-tilt tool in the package. With such a unique design, it will never shake or waggle like any other cheap shelf. (Maximum load capacity for each tier: 100 lbs). [ More Natural, Healthy, and eco-friendly Material ] Made of eco-friendly P2 degree particle wood with high resistance to scratch & friction, with PVC surface, waterproof, and easy to clean. [ Easy TO Maintain ] This rustic bookcase with 4 storage cabinets can match perfectly with any other furniture in your house. You will be surprised that it is such a good storage cabinet as well as an attractive decoration to your house. And you will never have trouble in maintaining it, for it won’t stain easily. With top quality, this vintage shelf can be used for a long time. [Easy Assembly & 100% Satisfation] Elaborate design and clear instruction through all steps allow you to effortlessly assemble this bookshelf in under 30minutes. Sedeta provides professional before and after customer service. Don't wait any longer and enjoy it right now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZFg7O3k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEDETA","source_asin":"B08P2PHSV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P2PHSV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P2PHSV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
