window.products.push({"id":272028,"name":"IKAPE Coffee Products, 58mm Coffee Distributor & Hand Tamper, Adjustable Depth Espresso Distributor Fits All 58mm Espresso Portafilter, Compatible wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-UHZe+veL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖💖 IKAPE has been working to create a product that combines a distributor/Leveler and tamper function into one unit. Fortunately, we did it. We built this dual-head espresso tamper and distributor, and with this professional dual-head mobile filter leveler and tamper, your espresso coffee skills and style will be taken to the next level. 💖💖 Warming Tips, evenly distributed ground coffee is an important step in achieving even coffee extraction. 💖 The following are the steps for extracting coffee: ☕ 🌼 Step 1: Fill your filter basket with the desired amount of freshly ground coffee powder.🌼 Step 2: Adjust the length of the distributor to the perfect depth and place the distributor on your bottomless naked portafilter with the four-page propeller blade facing down.🌼 Step 3: Gently rotate the distributor until the coffee grounds are evenly distributed and level. If the distributor does not reach the coffee ground, adjust the depth accordingly. (Warming Tips: You do not need to apply a lot of pressure to the coffee bottomless portafilter basket at this stage - just allow the basket to flatten out.)🌼 Step 4: Flip your tool over and use the flat bottom palm to tamp the coffee powder flat.🌼 Step 5: To maintain consistent tamping every time, adjust the tamping depth to match the tamping depth you created in step 4.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-UHZe+veL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKAPE","source_asin":"B09SH3F3G5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SH3F3G5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SH3F3G5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272029,"name":"OLEVS Gold Skeleton Men's Automatic Mechanical Watches self Winding Luxury Dress Shiny Diamond Stainess Steel Waterproof Luminous Wrist Watches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WvJpF+X0L._AC_.jpg","description":"⌚ Gold Skeleton Watches : creative design double-sided gold skeleton face , smooth metal texture, shiny diamond scale, luxury appearance and superb watch craftsmanship, it is an exquisite match for luxury dress men's wrist watches. ⌚ Automatic Mechanical Watches : adopt high-quality mechanical movement, support automatic and manual winding. It continuously provides kinetic energy through the natural movement of the wrist, which makes timekeeping more accurate and has smaller errors than ordinary automatic watches. ⌚ 316L Stainless Steel : solid steel band has been polished many times to make it more durable and scratch-resistant. The concealed bi-fold butterfly buckle is convenient and comfortable to wear, and fits the wrist better without pinching hand hair. The band can be increased or decreased by the gift adjuster according to the size of the wrist. ⌚ Waterproof Watches : HD luminous effect is excellent, and it can display completely and clearly even in the dark. Sealed high-hardness coating mirror, wear-resistant and scratch-resistant, can swim, can bath in cold water but can not dive. ⌚ OLEVS Men Watches : we provide 30-day no-reason return refund and lifetime warranty for Men's Wrist Watches. If you have problems during the use of the wristwatch, you can contact us through Amazon, and the professional after-sales team will provide you with services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WvJpF+X0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLEVS","source_asin":"B09PZV9L9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PZV9L9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PZV9L9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272030,"name":"Aico Amini Hollywood Swank Pearl Desk with Metal Cabriole Legs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3599.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xa3G0R+IL._AC_.jpg","description":"You can have pure elegance in your home with the addition of Aico Amini Hollywood Swank Pearl Desk w Metal Legs double-pedestal desk. The Aico Amini Hollywood Swank Pearl Desk w Metal Legs carries a cavier finish and features beautiful diamond designs as well as metal cabriole feet. Plus, the table top surface allows for plenty of space to accomplish your daily goals. Allow your home office to shine with decadence with help from this Aico Amini Hollywood Swank Pearl Desk w Metal Legs stunning desk. Collection Description With classic glitz and endless glamor, the Hollywood Swank collection by Aico Michael Amini will bring the perfect marriage of drama and passion into your home setting. Breathing with old-Hollywood style, these office, living, dining and bedroom pieces from Michael Amini each embody a rich dialogue of supporting lines and elements as well as carry a variety of unique finishes and upholstery. In addition, elegant details such as butterfly door handles, light bulb-lined mirrors, symmetric metal trimming and cabriole legs add a level of stunning sophistication to the overall look. Liven any room in your home with dazzling designs by adding the Hollywood Swank collection by Aico Michael Armini to the decor. Purchase Includes: Hollywood Swank Pearl Desk w Metal Legs Only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xa3G0R+IL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aico Amini","source_asin":"B007ZUIDU2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007ZUIDU2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007ZUIDU2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272031,"name":"Oopsy Daisy Canvas Wall Art Jungle by Stephanie Bauer, 24 by 12-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DfPERW7LL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Children's wall art featuring colorful jungle full of animals. Canvas wall art is reproduced in our San Diego studios using the best digital reproduction method currently available, resulting in great clarity and color saturation. After printing, the canvas is stretched by hand over a custom built 1.5\" wood frame. The canvas wraps around the sides providing a finished decorative edge. A saw tooth hanger is attached for easy hanging and artist biography information is included on the back so that children can learn more about today's working artists. Canvases are exceptionally durable and can be cleaned with a soft, dry or slightly damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DfPERW7LL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oopsy Daisy","source_asin":"B00BEHQG6A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BEHQG6A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BEHQG6A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
