window.products.push({"id":272088,"name":"MEGO Luxury Shaggy Plush Duvet Cover Set, Soft 3 Pieces Fluffy Faux Fur Comforter Cover Set, Fuzzy Velvet Bedding Set King Size(1 Furry Duvet Cover + ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wS7DLda0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY MATERIAL: Our faux fur bedding set is made of soft and high qulity microfiber material. Luxurious 45mm fluffy long fur, brings a stunning touch of glam to your bedroom/guest room decor. The reverse side is made of ultra-soft and skin-friendly velvet material, comfortable, warm and smooth, to create a serene sleeping experience! Resistance to fade, wrinkles, shrink, pilling resistant and breathable. PACKAGE: Twin Size duvet cover set - 2 pc set includes one 66''*90'' duvet cover and one 20''*26'' pillow sham; Queen Size duvet cover set - 3 pc set includes one 90''*90'' duvet cover and two 20''*26'' pillow shams; King Size duvet cover set - 3 pc set includes one 90''*104'' duvet cover and two 20''*36'' pillow shams. FEATURES: Compared with general faux fur, our plush comforter set is more fluffy and thicker. With durable concealed zipper closure, you can easily insert the duvet into the fluffy cover, and your duvet will become luxuriousand warm. It is more than just a furry comforter cover, on summer days you can easliy take the duvet out and use it as a big bed blanket. This duvet cover set is a great choice for everyday use and also can be a great gift for everybody, festivals and other special occasion. CLEANING: Hidden zipper and four string ties is easy to remove the duvet and wash the cover set. Flip the quilt cover inside out, Dry Clean or Machine Wash in cold water. Gently cycle only(Dryer on Low/No Heat). We recommend shaking it outdoors before first use as it will be more fluffy and skin-friendly. CUSTOMER SERVICE: We provide life-time customer service and provide replacement and return service within 30 days. If you have any questions, please contact us directly, we will reply you within 24 hours and give you a satisfied answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wS7DLda0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEGO","source_asin":"B08HL9YWLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HL9YWLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HL9YWLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
