window.products.push({"id":272160,"name":"Eco-Friendly Food Platter Serving Tray - Cupcake Stand - Acacia Wooden Towers Dessert Table Display Set - 3 Tiered Decor Small Cheese Charcuterie Boar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g1ZmaG9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing our elegant and durable 3 Tier Cupcake Stand & Towers Serving Tray for Party, crafted from premium Acacia Wood - a step above cheap wooden and bamboo trays, and porcelain platters. Our wooden dessert table display set boasts a natural, rustic charm without any artificial finishes or quirky shine. It's larger and higher than competitor's charcuterie board sets, and hand-carved by professional craftsmen using only the finest logs, ensuring long-lasting quality. Our multi-functional tray can be used as a serving platter for parties and its collapsible rack makes it easy to store. Elevate your table centerpieces for dining room with this beautiful, elevated level wooden tray, perfect for any occasion or daily use. Its 3 tier serving tray design adds an antique touch to your platters and trays, and makes for an attractive individual serving tray for charcuterie, cheese, appetizers, snacks, pastries, crackers, cookies, candies, sandwiches, meats, and more. Each set comes in a warm gift box, making it a thoughtful present for any host. You'll receive 3 stackable trays measuring 17x8x0.8 inches each, and three collapsible racks measuring 17x8x9.5 inches, 17x8x6.5 inches, and 17x8x3.5 inches - larger and higher than other porcelain cake stands for dessert table. Cleaning and maintaining our wooden cupcake tower is a breeze. Simply hand wash with mild soap and cool water, and dry with a dish towel. It's also dishwasher safe, but not suitable for the microwave or refrigerator. For occasional use, apply mineral oil on the inside of the dessert plates to maintain its appearance. Experience the quality and beauty of our 3 Tier Cupcake Stand & Towers Serving Tray for Party - an essential addition to your kitchen and dining collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g1ZmaG9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EASY CATER","source_asin":"B0BRKKCYKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRKKCYKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRKKCYKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272161,"name":"David Scherer Handmade \"Small Heart\" Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MMLmA+8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"David Scherer is an American artist who works in a variety of mediums, bringing an intriguing, distinctive style and vibrancy to all of his three-dimensional works of art. Well known for his 3-D paintings, Scherer's pioneering focus and innovative techniques fuse the explosion of textures and colors to ignite energy evident in every creation. He attributes his unique direction to the expansion of his cumulative experience of more than 30 years as an artist. David's work is sold all over the world and can be found in numerous private and corporate collections. Energetic and complex, David Scherer's work captures the essence of the modern era, and the passion that is art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MMLmA+8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"David Scherer Studio","source_asin":"B004P482NE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004P482NE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004P482NE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
