window.products.push({"id":272225,"name":"DIMBRAH Olive Oil Dispenser Black, Farmhouse Oil Dispenser Bottle for Kitchen, Black Olive Oil Bottle with 2 No-drip Pourers and Funnel, Glass Oil Bot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CBCmXrTHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈VALUE OIL COOKING BOTTLE -- Lead-free glass olive oil bottle with a flexible spout makes it easy to dispense oil with the appropriate amount. The flip-top slightly hinders the oil flow, controlling pouring and flips shut to prevent dripping while lifting the bottle. 🌈AIRTIGHT & LEAKPROOF -- Double protection is provided with a push-in, easy-to-remove plug in addition to the screw-on cap. The bottle is easy to hold then you can pour and dispense oil smoothly without leaking. 🌈KEEP YOUR OLIVE OIL FRESH -- Stainless steel pour spouts with sealed cap and flap cap fit the oil dispenser bottle well and perfectly keep bugs or dust out. A black screw cap and white inner cork make long-term storage possible. 🌈ELEGANT DESIGN & CLEAN -- Slim and sleek, specially designed for a comfortable grip and easy hold. Cleaning the olive oil bottle is also easy, simply remove the pourers and rinse the bottles with soap and water (please note the bottles are hand wash only, do not use dishwasher) 🌈CLASSIC -- Elegant and premium. The opaque bottle and nonporous glazed interior keep oil in the dark to avoid oxidation and preserve taste. You can have matching cooking oil dispensers for your vinegar, salad dressing, chili oil, soy sauce, or olive oil. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CBCmXrTHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIMBRAH","source_asin":"B0B2487JQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2487JQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2487JQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272226,"name":"WEZVIX Anti Fatigue Kitchen Rugs and Mats 2 PCS, Cushioned Floor Mat Non-Skid, Ergonomic Comfort Foam Standing Mat, Waterproof Kitchen Rugs for Floor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ibalcTlgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANTI-FATIGUE: The anti-fatigue thick kitchen rug is ergonomically engineered to relieve feet and legs pressure. It can provide a perfect support and comfort for people who spend a lot of time on their feet or legs at work. Cushioned foam can improve circulation and standing posture while you work at kitchen or office. The thickness(0.5 inches / 12mm) makes the cushioned floor mat very durable. It is very soft and comfortable when you step on it. PREMIUM MATERIAL: The WEZVIX erconomic cushioned gel mat set is made of quality PVC material that is durable and eco-friendly to your family. The thick and high-density foam material that reduce discomfort on feet, knees, legs for an extended period. Strong and memory material can ensure that the kitchen runner standing mat keep their shape. Extra thick foam has a slow-rebound feature to protect your dropping dishes from breaking. NON-SLIP & NO TRIPPING: The rugs for kitchen are designed with non-skid baking. The PVC bottom keeps the memory foam kictchen mats stay in place and prevents you from slipping or shifting to enhance safety. [WARNING!!] Open rugs fully and place on even and flat floor, the standing pad will be back to normal in a few days. DO NOT BEND!!! When using, the cushioned rugs must be placed on the flat and dry floor to prevent moving around. EASY TO CLEAN: The kitchen runner rugs are easy to clean. Simply wipe dirt off with a wet cloth or sponge. The PVC material is waterproof, oil-resistant and stain-resistant. If it’s needed, you can use a hand-held vacuum to solve it. Organized pattern will not fade easily. In order to maintain the service life of the non-slip kitchen mats and rugs set, you can wash it slightly with water, but you can't soak it in water, because the mat is not completely waterproof. VERSATILITY: The kitchen anti fatigue mats are measured as 17.3×29 inches and 17.3×47 inches in dimension. ( Pay Attention to The Size ). The comfort rugs for kitchen come in two colors. Simple and elegant pattern is suitable for all kinds of decor. The standing pad provides extra large surface area for laundry, kitchen, office, living room, in front of the sink or other indoor or outdoor spaces. The premium material is built for long-lasting durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ibalcTlgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEZVIX","source_asin":"B0C5GV9YFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5GV9YFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5GV9YFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
