window.products.push({"id":272236,"name":"Allied Home Cooling Mattress Topper - 250 TC, 100% Cotton Mattress Cover, Thick Mattress Topper - Cotton Mattress Pad, Down Alternative Mattress Toppe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pDDRFWfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Hotel Mattress Topper for Cool & Comforting Sleep: Luxurious sleep doesn’t just happen in expensive hotels. Now, you can experience elite comfort and when dozing off to dreamland with our 54” x 75” x 1” mattress covers. These thick mattress toppers are made from 100% cotton. The plush mattress topper's 250 thread count for a more durable, tactile, and soft mattress pads tailored for all types of sleepers. Keep Your Cool: A tranquil and luxurious sleeping experience awaits with this pillow top mattress cover. No more waking up with a puddle of sweat on your bed, thanks to the cotton mattress pad's Phase Change Material that promotes optimal thermoregulation. The thick mattress pad absorbs heat from your body surface, liquefies, and traps it inside, making you feel cooler. The material solidifies and releases stored heat for a balanced temperature. Crafted & Engineered for Cool, Comfy Sleep: Why settle for bed cushions for mattress if you can lie and sleep on cooling mattress topper with carefully researched design and high-quality materials? Each plush mattress topper makes use of innovative materials for multi-layered softness and support. You've found a comfier way to hit the hay, thanks to our mattress covers' lofty down-like fiber fill crafted with a high-performance stretch skirt. Comfy Bed Mattress Topper Because Great Sleep is Luxury: Always look forward to snagging extra Zs with a cotton mattress pad made from outstanding quality cotton filled with soft and plush down-like fiber. All mattress pads are printed with Phase Change Material, allowing you to snag the extra Zs you badly need. With our extra thick mattress topper, every night is a 5-star sleeping experience. Luxurious Feel, Luxurious Look: Our soft mattress topper turns your bed into a softer, cozier sleeping sanctuary in more ways than one. The soft breathable fabric tailored for next-generation cooling features an elegant cloud quilt. Also, the mattress topper cooling is finished with ice blue satin piping detail. Indeed, a mattress cover that matches your bedroom's modern and sophisticated design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pDDRFWfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allied Essentials","source_asin":"B08KZG6RT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZG6RT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZG6RT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
