window.products.push({"id":272320,"name":"Gourmet Basics by Mikasa Zinnia Garden 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service For 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yeA5wk2SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make every meal an eye-opening experience with the pop Zinnia Garden, from the Kim Parker Collection by Gourmet Basics by Mikasa, brings to the table. Adorned with a bold prism of colors, even inside the bowl and mug, this whimsical collection is a joyful celebration of vibrant florals, and will breathe new life into any dining occasion. Crafted of porcelain. 32 piece dinnerware set, service for eight, includes (8) each: 10-1/2 inch dinner plate, 8 inch salad plate, 5-1/2 inch (24 ounce) soup cereal bowl and 14 ounce mug. Microwave and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yeA5wk2SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmet Basics by Mikasa","source_asin":"B01MZDFQJI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZDFQJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZDFQJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272321,"name":"BONECO Fan & Air Circulator F500","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61phoeFWsJL._AC_SL1139_.jpg","description":"The F500 is a fan with exceptional performance that can be adjusted to your needs. This high-performance fan clicks into place at your desired angle between 0 degree and 90 degree. This enables perfect air circulation throughout the room, providing a number of advantages: even distribution of cool air from your AC unit or circulation of fresh air through an open window. Thanks to its timer function, the unit can freshen up a room even before you enter. The F500 fits in anywhere with its futuristic design, even a bedroom. Its quiet operation ensures you can sleep through the night in peace. Additional features:  The fan clicks into the desired angle, no oscillation necessary, extremely energy efficient, remote control with a magnetic contact surface, futuristic and stable design, high quality components.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61phoeFWsJL._AC_SL1139_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BONECO","source_asin":"B01DONMNB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DONMNB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DONMNB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272322,"name":"Divano Roma Vanity Bench Stool Footrest, Tufted Microfiber Fabric Ottoman – Small Rectangular Bed Foot Bench Ottomans with Casters, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AMe2HgisL._AC_.jpg","description":"Divano Roma Furniture - Classic yet modern style footstool / footrest in various color options - Can also be used as an ottoman with caster legs. Upholstered in microfiber fabric with tufted details and tall dark wooden legs. Available in fun and/or conservative colors to best fit your home decor - Also perfect for a kid's princess theme bedroom! Minor assembly required - Instructions and hardware included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AMe2HgisL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Divano Roma Furniture","source_asin":"B072Q2WBK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072Q2WBK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072Q2WBK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272323,"name":"House, Home and More Skid-Resistant Carpet Runner - Gray - 8 Feet X 36 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":128.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vi2HceCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’ll walk confidently on your new carpet runner from House, Home and More! Thanks to its non-slip rubber backing, this runner won’t bunch up or shift under your feet. Your household will appreciate the added security in your walking spaces, especially older adults. Our carpet runners protect and add comfort to your hardwood or tile floors and help muffle sound throughout your home. WHERE DO RUNNER RUGS GO? Carpet runners are perfect for high-traffic areas like hallways, entryways and kitchens. Furniture isn’t traditionally placed on top of runners. If you’re placing your runner in a hallway with furniture, choose a width that allows you to move the furniture to one side of the hallway without resting on top of the runner. Narrow kitchens are ideal living spaces for runners. Time spent at the stove or cleaning up at the sink is more enjoyable with a carpet runner under your feet. Bringing runners into your bedroom provides warmth and comfort, especially on hard floors. If you’re placing runners at the sides and/or foot of your bed, you want to cover the length of the bed, outside of accent furniture like nightstands. ARE CARPET RUNNERS PET FRIENDLY? Our carpet runners offer stability and a cozy place for your pets to rest. The non-slip backing adds traction and helps to create a secure environment for your dogs, cats and other pets. Walking on slippery wood or tile floors can be cumbersome and frightening for senior dogs and cats. The soft surface of a runner will keep their paws comfy while the added traction allows them to move with confidence. If you have pets, you may want to consider a color or design that won’t showcase their shedding. HOW TO CARE FOR YOUR CARPET RUNNER: Our carpet runners feature a non-slip rubber backing which helps to keep them in place while vacuuming, but can become damaged if put into a washing machine. When your runner needs cleaning, we recommend vacuuming to remove surface dirt and spot cleaning areas that need extra care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vi2HceCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"House, Home and More","source_asin":"B004D0KW2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004D0KW2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004D0KW2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
