window.products.push({"id":272344,"name":"Andplay Soap Dispenser,Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless,370ml/12.5oz Silver Metal Spray Paint Electric for Home Kitchen Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hf1lpBOlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Long service life - The soap dispenser made of high-quality ABS material is durable and has a long service life. The soap dispenser is powered by 4 AAA batteries (Not included), and a spare battery can last about 3 months. ★Fast induction - non-contact operation and 0.2s quick response. Compared with other hand-held soap dispensers, our automatic soap dispenser has precise infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology, which can provide you with non-contact operation within 0.2 seconds. Contact experience and even, fast soap. ★Adjustable displacement - on/off switch and adjustable soap dispenser volume control switch. Just press the +/- button, the gel discharge of this soap dispenser can be quickly switched between 3 types of soap levels (1.5ml-3.5ml) to meet different needs. ★ Compatible hand sanitizer types - Andplay sensor soap dispenser is compatible with any kind of hand sanitizer, including water, gel hand sanitizer, alcohol, shower gel, etc. If the liquid is too viscous, you can add an appropriate amount of warm water and stir. ★IPX6 Waterproof - The soap dispenser is designed with IPX6 waterproof and leak-proof technology, which can prevent soap or water from corroding the circuit board, especially in wet places such as bathrooms or kitchen sinks. In addition, the latest waterproof base design with rubber seal prevents the battery box from being corroded due to immersion in water. ★Excellent customer service - We will provide you with 18 months warranty service. We will solve any problems you encounter during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hf1lpBOlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andplay","source_asin":"B08MBPTMJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MBPTMJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MBPTMJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
