window.products.push({"id":272356,"name":"Kogonee Wooden Digital Alarm Clock, 0-100% Dimmer, 2 Alarm Settings, Weekday/Everyday Mode, 9 Mins Snooze, 12/24H, Temperature and Date Display for Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x851w9bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【0～100% Brightness Adjustable】 This wooden alarm clock has more clear LED digits with 0～100% full range dimmable, you can easily adjust to your favorite or suitable brightness level, even the LED lights can be turned off completely. It’s user friendly at night, which won’t be too harsh for your eyes. Therefore, you can also have a comfortable night's sleep. ⏰【2 Display Formats, Support Switching】 Alarm clock with LARGER screen clearly shows the date, day of the week, time (12-hour/24-hour mode switching), 2 alarms (Alarm 1 & Alarm 2 display icons) and the temperature (°C/ °F switchable), so you can get the important informations at the same time. USB power supply, time memory function, meet your needs and bring you a better user experience. ⏰【Dual Alarm & 9 Mins Snooze】 You can set 2 alarms, one for you and the other for your families, effectively saying goodbye to being late. Also, it allows you to set Weekday mode, which will ring only on Monday to Friday. This multifunctional wood alarm clock also has a snooze function, when the alarm goes off, you can activate the 9-minute snooze function with a single press of any button. ⏰【Volume Adjustable & Easy to Use】 The volume of this digital alarm clock is adjustable from 60dB - 90dB, you can set a volume level that suits you. Don't worry about the alarm being too loud in the morning to startle you or your family, or too low to wake you up. In addition, it adopts humanized design, enough buttons ​and simple operation process, you can quickly adjust your wooden alarm clock. ⏰【Stylish Wooden Clock for Home Decor】 This exquisite alarm clock is made of high-quality wood material, combined with stylish design. Therefore, it's not only a clock, but also a great decoration for your bedroom. You can put it anywhere on the bedside table, nightstand or desk in your home. Stylish appearance and multiple functions make it suitable as a gifts for family or friends. ⏰【High-quality & Reliable After-sales】 We offer 90 days money back guarantee and 1year free repleacment service, if there is any quality problem with the wooden digital clock you purchased from us, please contact us by email in time, 7*24 hours professional after-sales service will provide you with 100% Satisfied solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x851w9bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kogonee","source_asin":"B09SHJQYT7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHJQYT7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHJQYT7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272357,"name":"VEGOND 20oz Tumbler Bulk with Lid and Straw 12 Pack, Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler, Double Wall Coffee Cup Travel Mug, Rose Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mso8TRTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DOUBLE-WALL INSULATION】: Our classic water tumblers are double walled and vacuum insulated, which keeps your drinks hot up to 4 hours or cold up to 9 hours. The high-quality, no-sweat design ensures your desk stays free of condensation. 【STAINLESS STEEL SKINNY TUMBLER】: Made of 18/8 food grade stainless steel with Paint coating, no more worries about peeling or rusting.Highly durable construction and splash-proof design make the travel tumbler great for indoor and outdoor use, it's an ideal coffee tumbler for keeping. Dishwasher cleaning is not recommended 【PORTABLE&ECO-FRIENDLY】: Thanks to its slim and sleek body, it is easy to carry and store , also it fits in most cupholders. BPA-free slider lid and plastic reusable straw are totally eco-friendly and safe for drinking. 【PERFECT GIFT SET】: Each insulated tumbler comes with 1 x splash-proof lid and 1 x plastic straw. This 20oz tumbler is a stylish and practical gift for your friends, families, or colleagues on birthday, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Mother's Day or Father's Day. 【PRACTICAL TUMBLER】: The coffee tumbler with sliding lid can be used as wine cups, champagne cups, water cup or sports fan travel mugs, suitable for parties, picnics, self-driving travelling, boats, beach, pool, camping and hiking, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mso8TRTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEGOND","source_asin":"B08YR92J6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YR92J6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YR92J6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
