window.products.push({"id":272570,"name":"KUAYIXIA Blinds for Windows Dual Layer Zebra Roller Shades, Blackout & Light Filtering, 25\" W X 72\" H, Day and Night Blinds, Room Darkening Shades for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sS-jLvBlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Intelligent light control: The zebra blinds combine sheer mesh and opaque fabric slats dual layers to allow you to control the level of light, ventilation, and privacy. Balance indoor and outdoor temperatures, keeping it cool in summer and warm in winter to help you a lot in energy-saving. In the daylight, you can let the sunlight naturally filter into the room to enjoy the sun. In the night, you can simply align the zebra stripes for total privacy. Thickened Rod & Elegant appearance: Our zebra roller shades are equipped with an environmentally-friendly thickened bottom rod, which is not easy to deform and adds the verticality of the roller window blind. The fashion and simple appearance make the blackout roller blinds very suitable for most decoration styles and room environments. The newest upgrade design of the cover box makes the blackout shades fit the windows perfectly and you do not need to worry about light disturbing your sleep. Easy to Install & Two Mount Ways: Newest design integrated installation angle code is convenient for you to install the roller shades. For inside mount, the depth of window frame is at least 2.5 inches. Roller shades width needs to be at least 1/4 inch less than the window width for a convenient lift. For outside mount, roller shade width should be 3\" to 6\" larger than the window outside width, shade length should be 6\" larger than the window outside length for full coverage. Various Occasions: The blinds for windows are 25 inches wide and 72 inches long. You can adjust the chain to pull down and up the window shades for home and keep the shades stay in place wherever you want. The length of the window shade is from 0 to 72\". Plenty of sizes and colors are for you to choose from. Suitable for bedroom, study, kitchen, living room, office. A perfect choice to let your bedroom become elegant and silent. Easy maintenance & After-sale service: Simply use a damp cloth or feather duster to clean the room darkening shades. Providing customers with the best products and services has always been our primary goal. If you have any questions about zebra window shades, please do not hesitate to email us. We will spare our efforts to provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sS-jLvBlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUAYIXIA","source_asin":"B09YYPX3W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYPX3W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYPX3W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
