window.products.push({"id":272905,"name":"Arus Women's Soft Touch Turkish Velour Cotton Fleece Bath Towel Wrap P/S Plum, Large/X-Large, Royal Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611sh+-KTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Arus Women's Adjustable Hook and Loop Closure on Chest Turkish Velour Cotton Fleece Bath Towel Wrap Our softest Bath Wrap ever! You may now enjoy the softness of fleece to go with the absorbency of world famous Turkish toweling. This functional, absorbent and soft Bath Spa Shower Towel Wrap is made of plush velour fleece material for extreme softness on the outside and Terry Cotton on the inside for great absorbency. Made in Turkey with high quality Turkish cotton by Arus. This wrap is perfect for spa, travel, sauna, beach and fitness. You can take your wrap anywhere you go. Hook and Loop Closing for better fitting allows you to adjust your wrap based on your preference. Washing Instructions: Please wash and dry with the Hook and Loop Closed to keep your wrap in its original condition. Sizing Information: Available in Sizes P/S, S/M and L/XL Detailed Bath Wrap Length / Circumference information: Size Petite/Small : 28\" / 53\" Size Small/Medium : 30\" / 59\" Size Large/XL: 33\" / 61\" What is so special about Turkish bath wraps and bathrobes ? There are different qualities of cotton used in bathrobes and wraps. The highest quality is called the High Grade Cotton known for its softness. Turkish bathrobes and bath wraps are manufactured from the highest grade cotton with extra long fibers grown in the Aegean region resulting in unmatched absorbency, therefore; it is important to buy a 'Turkish Terry Cotton' bathrobe or shower wrap to get the highest quality when shopping for a long lasting robe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611sh+-KTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arus","source_asin":"B00WELWG0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WELWG0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WELWG0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272906,"name":"Objet D'Art Release #378 \"Karaoke Idol\" Golden Singer's Microphone Handmade Jeweled Enameled Metal Trinket Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n5I-mdjTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Karaoke from the Japanese kara empty and okesutora orchestra is a form of interactive entertainment in which amateur singers sing along with recorded music using a microphone and public address system. The music is typically a well known pop song minus the lead vocal. Its popularity inspired hit TV shows like American Idol. We made the microphone into a cute little trinket box which to any inspiring singer will make perfect girft, 100% handmade with love. From the Manufacturer Artform: n. “An undertaking or activity enhanced by a high level of skill or refinement.” In a world so focused on “advancing” technology, its rare to find a company and product dedicated to “turning back the clock”, by making things of beauty the old fashioned way; by hand. Introducing Artform Fine Collectibles. Based in exciting Las Vegas Nevada, and dedicated to the fine art of imagination. From humble beginnings, we have assembled one of the largest collections of unique collectible trinket boxes in compelling categories of interest, such as our famous “gambling and Vegas”, critically endangered species, “America’s Heroes”, musical instruments, “World Heritage Sites and many many more. There exists a must have product for everyone in this expansive catalogue. Using age-old techniques of metalworking and precision jewelery making, this beautiful line of handmade collectibles embody the dedication and com- mitment of our skilled artisans; making every one we produce, singularily unique; each a keepsake worth cherishing for a lifetime. It all starts with our hundreds of unique designs, inspired by life and forged into miniature. An idea becomes a sketch and the process begins as hand-cast fine pewter is forged into a shell skillfully prepared, precious metal plated, enameled and embellished with fine Austrian crystal, all 100% by hand. “A permanent, tangible expression of love”, we call these beautiful curios. So much more meaningful and expressive than a greeting card. They become the perfect gift; matched to the dreams and passions of the recipient; beautifully packaged in our signature handmade giftbox with embossed certificate of authenticity and fine linen presentation card and matching envelope. Un- matched in quality; a gift worth giving for any occasion. We call all of this “objet d’art”; or “work of art”, limited only by the boundaries of your imagination . . .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n5I-mdjTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Objet d' Art","source_asin":"B004FD2OAC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004FD2OAC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004FD2OAC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272907,"name":"Nicedec 4.4lb / 2kg 6-Pack Stainless Steel Hooks, Premium Metal Hooks Heavy Duty Hooks Pack, Easy to Install and Remove, Hooks for Hanging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jY6WmvxVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Carrys up to 4.4lb/2kg Good flexibility makes this metal hook stick to surfaces strongly and stably and can take weight up to 4.4lb/2kg. Specification Material: Stainless Steel  Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel  Capacity: Max. 4.4lb/2kg Package includes Nicedec 4.4lb / 2kg stainless steel hook * 6 Note: Please be noted that the whole package comes with two separated packing with three hooks in each packing. How to remove 1. Insert a piece of knife between the adhesive of this hook and wall surface  2. Use a piece of cloth wetted with organic solvent to wipe away the adhesive remains on the surface. Make sure that a test should be done to choose the proper solvent that does not cause damage to the surface Tips *On painted walls, It is recommended not to hand over 2.2lb/1kg, since the painted wall is much more weaker than other walls which is very easy to fall off. *Please keep it far away from the high temperature object like gas cooker, gas stove, etc. And please wait 24 hours before use. *The adhesive will work better if you warm it up before use. Customer Service You can always contact us by clicking “contact seller” in your order for any product question or issue, or anything regarding our products and services. We are always here to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jY6WmvxVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nicedec","source_asin":"B00ZEUSBX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZEUSBX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZEUSBX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272908,"name":"Airware Aeromats Pro Reusable Air Fryer Liners | 3-Pack and Magnetic Cook Times List | Air Fryer Accessories For NINJA, INSTANT VORTEX, GOURMIA, MORE ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S9dRgFtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE CLEANUP A BREEZE AND PROTECT YOUR FRYER - Airware Aeromats, 8-Inch Round - The Original silicone air fryer liners designed to improve cleaning time and save money on the need for single use parchment papers for your air fryer or pressure cooker. They're also eco-friendly, heat resistant, and BPA free. Airware is family owned and operated in the USA. UNIVERSAL FIT FOR 5.7 QT AND SMALLER AIR FRYERS - Our 8-Inch round air fryer liners fit into most small and medium size baskets and is compatible with most mainstream air fryer and pressure cooker brands. Fits into air fryer accessories such as an air fryer pot, air fryer rack, air fryer crisper tray, air fryer tray or air fryer grill plate. They can also be used as a silicone trivet for your hot basket to protect your countertop. EASY TO WASH, DISHWASHER SAFE – After you’re finished frying, easily wash Aeromats by hand or put them in the dishwasher for added convenience. PERFORATED DESIGN KEEPS FOOD CRISPY – Airware Aeromats feature a perforated design to ensure optimal air flow around food items for crispy, even cooking. HEAT-RESISTANT & BPA FREE – Airware uses SGS-certified, food grade silicone that can handle up to 430 F degrees for safe air frying, food steaming, and oven baking. Avoid bleach parchment paper rounds or potentially toxic materials such as PFOA, PFAS, or heavy metals from an aging non-stick basket coating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S9dRgFtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airware","source_asin":"B0BS8Z4CL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS8Z4CL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS8Z4CL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":272909,"name":"MAYZOLOP Kitchen Countertop Utensil Holder, Stainless Steel Rotatable Cooking Utensils Holder with 8 Rotating Hooks, Hanging Organizer for Spoon, Spat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RcMGTWaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Widely Used Utensil Holder】: Ideal for holding cooking and baking kitchen tools this metal utensil holder features 8 individual hanging hooks that let you hang and organize spoons, spatulas, and other essential kitchen accessories which come with a loophole. Utensils Not Included. 【360 Degrees Design】: You can put your utensils such as spaghetti sever, slotted spoon, soup ladle, flipper spatula, potato masher, and whisk that enough for you everyday’s cooking and fit compactly on the swivel kitchen utensil holder. It is as easy as a flick of the wrist and the floating head turns 360 degrees. Convenient for you to take off or hang. 【Heavy-duty】: Heavy Weight, Big Size, Slip-Resistant– Our kitchen utensil holder features an anti-skid soft EVA bottom to protect countertops and a weightier 1.65 lb to keep it from tipping or leaning when you put the utensils around the outside. 【High Quality 304 Stainless Steel Kitchen Cooking Utensils Holder】: Made of food grade 304 stainless steel and ebony handle. Rustproof, durable and will last long. You will enjoy years of preparing meals for your family and loved ones. 【Easy Installation】: MAYZOLOP kitchen tools holder comes with all necessary accessories. You don't have to spend hours to install it, just follow the instructions and your kitchen utensil rack will be ready to use in a few minutes! 【Easy to Clean, Storage】: Clean and wash with a soft cloth after use, easy to clean and dishwasher safe.Attractive, sturdy holder keeps all utensils handy and organized. 【Satisfaction Guarantee 】We work closely with the manufacturer to ensure our product is up to quality standards. If for any reason you are not satisfied with the product, please feel free to send us an email and we will offer you full refund or a replacement for a free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RcMGTWaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAYZOLOP","source_asin":"B09NQWSSYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NQWSSYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NQWSSYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
