window.products.push({"id":272913,"name":"Classic Brands Classic Brands Claridge Upholstered Mattress Foundation | Platform Bed | Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support | Grey, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91v6SYwuMQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Classic Brands DeCoro Claridge Upholstered Platform | Bed Frame with Wood Slat Support is a tailored platform frame that creates a soft and stylish effect that works well in a variety of bedrooms. Update the look of your room by adding the Claridge upholstered platform frame. The Claridge is constructed with metal tubing that is not only strong but lightweight and long-lasting. Designed with exceptional quality, the Claridge can be used with any mattress size or type; no box-spring is needed. The low-profile bed frame has a strong center support with a durable wooden slat support system. Combine our Classic Brands DeCoro Claridge Upholstered Platform Bed | Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support with your memory foam, latex, or innerspring mattress to add unparalleled support. It will extend the longevity of your mattress by properly supporting your mattress, and ultimately preventing it from sagging. The slats are specifically designed to be spaced evenly across the top of the platform to form a solid base for your mattress, insuring even weight distribution throughout. The sturdy center support system is a must have for today’s heavier mattresses and is not typically found in other platform beds and is what really differentiates our bed frame from others. Benefits of the Classic Brands DeCoro Claridge Upholstered Platform Bed Classic Brands DeCoro Claridge Upholstered Platform Bed is a decorative way to give your mattress some extra support. The foundation, wood slats, and frame are an all in one solution and is an excellent choice as a fashionable alternative to a traditional box spring and frame. You’ll love the way this platform bed enhances the look of your bedroom. Features of the Classic Brands DeCoro Claridge Upholstered Platform Bed With classic styling, the Classic Brands DeCoro Claridge Upholstered Platform Bed is perfect for trendy and modern bedrooms. Not only is the platform bed well-built and durable, it’s sleek and modern look instantly updates the feel of your bedroom. The upholstered fabric is soft to the touch and the platform bed is available in grey and is now available in twin, twin extra long, full, queen, king or california sizes. Easy Assembly The Classic Brands DeCoro Upholstered Platform Bed is easy to assemble; it can be put together in less than an hour. All parts, tools, and instructions are neatly packed in a zippered compartment in with the platform bed . Just unpack, assemble the frame and attach the hardware and you are ready to place your mattress (and foundation if you please) on top. It is recommended that the upholstered bed frame should be assembled in the room that it is intended for use. Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to check the size and the height of your mattress to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of the frame, foundation (if you are adding one), and the mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your bed will be. Also note, because of the solid construction of this platform bed, it is recommended that two people lift and assemble the bed. Total weight should not exceed 700 lbs. including the mattress. • Twin Size - 39\" W x 75\" L x 16\" H x 46 lbs • Twin XL Size - 39\" W x 80\" L x 16\" H x 49 lbs • Full Size - 54\" W x 75\" L x 16\" H x 54 lbs • Queen Size - 60\" W x 80\" L x 16\" H x 61 lbs • King Size - 76\" W x 80\" L x 16\" H x 72 lbs • California King Size - 72\" W x 84\" L x 16\" H x 71 lbs Quality Assurance Classic Brands DeCoro Upholstered Platform Bed | Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support is backed with a 3-year worry-free warranty. Classic Brands carries a wide variety of DeCoro upholstered platform bed frames in an assortment of designs to match your unique taste and style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91v6SYwuMQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B079W5GHMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-272913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079W5GHMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079W5GHMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
